+     * crosses a 0x1000 boundary that the 0x2000 rounding does not, the declared
+     * image is a page short of the section and the loader rejects the file with
+     * STATUS_INVALID_IMAGE_FORMAT. Two of Wine's own shipped winmds
+     * (windows.networking, windows.ui.xaml) are unloadable for this reason. */
